<title>USA: Kansas City Life Insurance Co Q3 net down.</title>
<headline>Kansas City Life Insurance Co Q3 net down.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.50		    $1.69</p>
<p> Net			  9,314		   10,444</p>
<p> Revs		     105,677		  103,041</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 net income after $0.11 a share in realized gains, net of tax, vs $0.37 a year ago.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 total revenues include $1,032,000 in realized investment gains vs $3,505,000.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $5.10		    $4.98</p>
<p> Net			 31,556		   30,754</p>
<p> Revs		     314,634		  302,129</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,188		    6,172</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 net is after $0.16 a share in realized gains vs $0.38.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 oper income before gains was $4.94/shr vs $4.60.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 revenues are after $1,502,000 in realized gains vs $3,651,000.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
